@* What AIT does to keep secrets and data safe. Opens by itself until it is closed once on this installation
   (site.js initSecurityNotice, POST /api/security/acknowledge), and again from the sidebar button "Keamanan & privasi".
   The status line is filled from GET /api/security. *@
<div class="modal fade" id="securityNoticeModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="securityNoticeTitle" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-dialog-scrollable modal-lg">
        <div class="modal-content security-notice">
            <div class="modal-header win-bar">
                <win-controls for="modal" />
                <h5 class="modal-title" id="securityNoticeTitle">@Html.Raw(Lang.T("Keamanan &amp; privasi di AIT", "Security &amp; privacy in AIT"))</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <figure class="onboarding-figure">
                    <svg class="ob-svg" viewBox="0 0 560 150" role="img" aria-label="@Lang.T("Isi file dan prompt melewati AIT; secret diganti placeholder sebelum dikirim ke model lewat 9router. Saat model menulis perubahan, AIT memasang nilai aslinya kembali ke file Anda.", "File contents and prompts go through AIT; secrets are replaced by placeholders before they are sent to a model through 9router. When the model writes changes, AIT puts the real values back into your files.")">
                        @* Its own arrowhead: the tour's #obArrow sits in a hidden modal, where markers are not drawn. *@
                        <defs>
                            <marker id="secArrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
                                <path class="ob-arrowhead" d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" />
                            </marker>
                        </defs>

                        <rect class="ob-panel" x="8" y="30" width="128" height="90" rx="10" />
                        <text class="ob-t ob-strong" x="72" y="54" text-anchor="middle">@Html.Raw(Lang.T("File &amp; prompt", "Files &amp; prompts"))</text>
                        <text class="ob-m ob-mono" x="20" y="78">DB_PASSWORD=</text>
                        <text class="ob-m ob-mono ob-ok-text" x="20" y="94">s3cr3t!Pass</text>
                        <text class="ob-m" x="72" y="112" text-anchor="middle">@Lang.T("di komputer Anda", "on your computer")</text>

                        <path class="ob-arrow" style="marker-end: url(#secArrow)" d="M140 62 H175" />
                        <path class="ob-arrow" style="marker-end: url(#secArrow)" d="M175 92 H140" />

                        <rect class="ob-panel ob-accent-stroke" x="180" y="20" width="200" height="110" rx="12" />
                        <circle class="ob-accent" cx="280" cy="46" r="15" />
                        <text class="ob-on-accent ob-strong" x="280" y="51" text-anchor="middle">AIT</text>
                        <text class="ob-t ob-sm" x="280" y="86" text-anchor="middle">@Lang.T("🔒 samarkan saat keluar", "🔒 masked on the way out")</text>
                        <text class="ob-t ob-sm" x="280" y="108" text-anchor="middle">@Lang.T("✍️ pasang lagi saat menulis", "✍️ put back when writing")</text>

                        <path class="ob-arrow" style="marker-end: url(#secArrow)" d="M385 62 H420" />
                        <path class="ob-arrow" style="marker-end: url(#secArrow)" d="M420 92 H385" />

                        <rect class="ob-panel" x="424" y="30" width="128" height="90" rx="10" />
                        <text class="ob-t ob-strong" x="488" y="54" text-anchor="middle">9router → model</text>
                        <text class="ob-m ob-mono" x="436" y="78">DB_PASSWORD=</text>
                        <text class="ob-m ob-mono ob-accent-text" x="436" y="94">{{AIT_SECRET…}}</text>
                        <text class="ob-m" x="488" y="112" text-anchor="middle">@Lang.T("tidak melihat nilainya", "never sees the values")</text>
                    </svg>
                </figure>

                <p class="mb-3">
                    @Lang.T("AIT membaca kode Anda supaya model AI bisa bekerja. Isinya melewati AIT dulu sebelum sampai ke model, sehingga AIT bisa menjaga apa yang ikut terkirim dan apa yang tersimpan. Berikut yang dilakukan AIT:", "AIT reads your code so AI models can work on it. The content passes through AIT before it reaches a model, so AIT can guard what is sent and what is stored. This is what AIT does:")
                </p>

                <div class="row g-3 security-points">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="security-point">
                            <div class="security-point-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔒</div>
                            <div>
                                <h6>@Lang.T("Secret disamarkan sebelum sampai ke model", "Secrets are masked before they reach a model")</h6>
                                <p>@Html.Raw(Lang.T("Password, API key, token, JWT, private key, dan password di connection string atau URL diganti placeholder <span class=\"mono\">{{AIT_SECRET:…}}</span>. Model tetap tahu nama pengaturannya, tetapi tidak melihat nilainya. Ini berlaku untuk file yang dibaca, prompt, riwayat chat, output build/test, dan respons aplikasi saat testing.", "Passwords, API keys, tokens, JWTs, private keys, and passwords in connection strings or URLs are replaced by the placeholder <span class=\"mono\">{{AIT_SECRET:…}}</span>. The model still knows the setting name, but does not see its value. This applies to files read, prompts, chat history, build/test output, and application responses while testing."))</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="security-point">
                            <div class="security-point-icon" aria-hidden="true">✍️</div>
                            <div>
                                <h6>@Lang.T("Nilai asli hanya dipasang saat menulis file", "Real values are put back only when writing files")</h6>
                                <p>@Lang.T("Nilai aslinya hanya disimpan di memori proses AIT, tidak ditulis ke disk. Nilai itu dipasang kembali ketika executor menulis ke file Anda, atau sebelum Claude Code menjalankan Edit/Write/Bash. Untuk Claude Code, Anda tetap diminta konfirmasi seperti biasa.", "The real values are kept only in the memory of the AIT process, never written to disk. They are put back when an executor writes to your files, or before Claude Code runs Edit/Write/Bash. For Claude Code, you are still asked to confirm as usual.")</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="security-point">
                            <div class="security-point-icon" aria-hidden="true">🚫</div>
                            <div>
                                <h6>@Lang.T("File kredensial tidak pernah dibaca", "Credential files are never read")</h6>
                                <p>@Html.Raw(Lang.T("Kunci dan sertifikat (<span class=\"mono\">.pem</span>, <span class=\"mono\">.key</span>, <span class=\"mono\">.pfx</span>), kunci SSH, <span class=\"mono\">.git-credentials</span>, <span class=\"mono\">.npmrc</span>, folder <span class=\"mono\">/.ssh</span> dan <span class=\"mono\">/.aws</span>, user-secrets .NET, serta data AIT sendiri tidak dibaca dan tidak diubah agen AIT. Aturan yang sama ditambahkan ke <span class=\"mono\">permissions.deny</span> Claude Code.", "Keys and certificates (<span class=\"mono\">.pem</span>, <span class=\"mono\">.key</span>, <span class=\"mono\">.pfx</span>), SSH keys, <span class=\"mono\">.git-credentials</span>, <span class=\"mono\">.npmrc</span>, the <span class=\"mono\">/.ssh</span> and <span class=\"mono\">/.aws</span> folders, .NET user-secrets, and AIT's own data are not read or changed by AIT agents. The same rules are added to Claude Code's <span class=\"mono\">permissions.deny</span>."))</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="security-point">
                            <div class="security-point-icon" aria-hidden="true">💾</div>
                            <div>
                                <h6>@Lang.T("Tidak ikut tersimpan atau terbagi", "Not stored or shared along")</h6>
                                <p>@Lang.T("Prompt, log aktivitas, catatan investigasi planner, memory, wiki bisnis, dan file export memory disamarkan sebelum disimpan. Jadi secret tidak menyebar ke tim saat memory atau wiki dibagi.", "Prompts, activity logs, planner investigation notes, memory, the business wiki and memory export files are masked before they are stored. So secrets do not spread to the team when memory or the wiki is shared.")</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="security-point">
                            <div class="security-point-icon" aria-hidden="true">🏠</div>
                            <div>
                                <h6>@Lang.T("Data tetap di komputer Anda", "Data stays on your computer")</h6>
                                <p>@Lang.T("Database, memory, dan log tersimpan lokal, kecuali Anda memindahkannya ke database tim. AIT tidak mengirim telemetri. Koneksi keluar hanya ke 9router (lalu provider model pilihan Anda), Telegram bila diaktifkan, cek versi npm, dan unduhan yang Anda minta (skill, browser untuk testing).", "The database, memory and logs are stored locally, unless you move them to a team database. AIT sends no telemetry. Outgoing connections go only to 9router (and then the model providers you chose), Telegram when enabled, the npm version check, and downloads you ask for (skills, the testing browser).")</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="security-point">
                            <div class="security-point-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔑</div>
                            <div>
                                <h6>@Html.Raw(Lang.T("Kunci &amp; login dijaga", "Keys &amp; logins are guarded"))</h6>
                                <p>@Html.Raw(Lang.T("API key 9router dan token Telegram disimpan terenkripsi. Login untuk testing hanya ada di memori, dan model hanya melihat <span class=\"mono\">{{password}}</span>. Tester hanya boleh mengakses <span class=\"mono\">localhost</span>, dan endpoint pengembali secret hanya menjawab request dari komputer ini.", "The 9router API key and the Telegram token are stored encrypted. Logins for testing exist only in memory, and the model only sees <span class=\"mono\">{{password}}</span>. The Tester may only reach <span class=\"mono\">localhost</span>, and the endpoint that puts secrets back only answers requests from this computer."))</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="alert alert-secondary small mt-3 mb-2">
                    @Html.Raw(Lang.T("<strong>Batasannya:</strong> penyamaran ini mengenali secret dari pola dan nama setting. Secret dengan format tidak lazim, atau yang ditulis langsung di kode tanpa nama pengaturan yang jelas, bisa lolos. Simpan secret di user-secrets atau environment variable, dan tambahkan nama pengaturan khusus project Anda di <span class=\"mono\">.aithread/project.json</span> (<span class=\"mono\">\"secrets\": { \"keys\": [...] }</span>).", "<strong>Limits:</strong> the masking recognizes secrets by pattern and setting name. Secrets with an unusual format, or written straight into code without a clear setting name, can slip through. Keep secrets in user-secrets or environment variables, and add your project's own setting names in <span class=\"mono\">.aithread/project.json</span> (<span class=\"mono\">\"secrets\": { \"keys\": [...] }</span>)."))
                </div>
                <p class="small text-secondary mb-0" id="securityNoticeStatus"></p>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer justify-content-between">
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" asp-controller="Setting" asp-action="Index" asp-fragment="keamanan">@Lang.T("Atur di Pengaturan", "Set it in Setting")</a>
                    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="~/Docs/12-keamanan">@Lang.T("Baca selengkapnya", "Read more")</a>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">@Lang.T("Saya mengerti", "I understand")</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
